      "text": "[9:22PM] #Ogolonto #TrafficUpdate \n\nItanwolo to Oríta Aje and after Ogoloto intersection to Aunty Kenny is moving well. However, approaching Ogoloto intersection and Agric is slow due to traffic and commercial activities, respectively. \nThe return journey from Haruno to Agric is good, but Ishawo is a bit slow due to commercial activities. \nOther routes like Ogoloto to Obasekumade Road, Ebute Police Post to Igbogbo, and Police Post to Ita Elewa are clear in both directions. \nNo major impediments are reported, and officers are on ground managing traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
